# Rebuild Debug Target After Changes

After finishing code changes in this repo, always produce a fresh debug binary before ending the turn.

- Run `cargo build --package star-client` (debug profile, not `--release`).
- Do this after the last successful compile/test of the change, even if tests already compiled the crate.
- If the debug build fails, fix the failure before considering the task done.
- Skip only when the turn made no compilable source/build-script changes (docs, rules, comments-only, or git-only work).
